---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SubPageNav from "../components/SubPageNav.astro";
import SlimNav from "../components/SlimNav.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Square Bubbles Copyright & Licensing — Q888"
  description="Copyright, attribution, collaboration, and licensing principles for artworks, symbolic systems, software, stories, and interdimensional materials created by Q888."
  image="/images/square_bubble.webp"
  canonicalPath="/copyright/"
>
  <SubPageNav />
  <div class="hidden md:block"><SlimNav /></div>

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--bg-cosmic)] text-[var(--text-silver)] relative">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:px-12 md:py-24 lg:px-24 lg:py-28"
      style="padding-top: max(5rem, calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 4rem)); padding-right: max(1.5rem, calc(env(safe-area-inset-right) + 1rem));">
      <h1 class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[var(--text-silver-muted)] mb-10 md:mb-12">
        ❐ Square Bubbles Copyright
      </h1>
      <div class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base tracking-[0.05em] leading-relaxed space-y-5 md:space-y-6 text-[var(--text-silver)]">
        <p>
          Square Bubbles copyright is defined under the Interdimensional Creative Continuity Act (Zero Day Revision) as all works manifested by Q888, affiliated entities, symbolic systems, or sentient geometries in the course of artistic, speculative, or narrative operations.
        </p>
        <p>
          Square Bubbles copyright covers material created within this dimension and adjacent narrative layers. This includes (but is not limited to):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2">
          <li>Symbolic systems and narrative tools</li>
          <li>Digital Ink artifacts</li>
          <li>Dream maps and cartographic experiments</li>
          <li>Overpriced Stickers (limited-edition instruments of speculative value)</li>
          <li>Project Infocigan materials</li>
          <li>Interdimensional Catan expansions</li>
          <li>Kotiki-Nar transmissions</li>
          <li>Nar-Mail Express documentation</li>
          <li>Websites, code, sketches, manifestos, and ceremonial announcements</li>
          <li>Social media echoes and reality glitches</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Square Bubbles copyright applies whether the work was created deliberately, accidentally, prophetically, or through mild cosmic interference.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where collaborations occur, copyright may be shared, entangled, or exist simultaneously in multiple realities. In such cases, agreements are governed by mutual respect and good coffee.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Copyright duration:</strong><br />
          Valid for as long as imagination persists, and not less than ±70 light years after the final observable ripple.
        </p>
        <section id="image-licensing" class="space-y-5 md:space-y-6 scroll-mt-20" aria-labelledby="image-licensing-title">
          <h2 id="image-licensing-title" class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--text-silver)]">
            Image licensing
          </h2>
          <p>
            Unless a specific work states otherwise, images and artworks published on q888.space are protected by copyright and are not offered under an open or Creative Commons licence.
          </p>
          <p>
            The default Square Bubbles rights notice is:<br />
            <em>"Observe. Do not steal. If inspired, transform honestly."</em>
          </p>
          <p>
            To request permission for editorial, exhibition, commercial, research, or other reuse, contact Aleksandrs Sestakovs / Q888 at <a href="mailto:hello@q888.space" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">hello@q888.space</a>. Include the image URL, intended use, publication or project name, territory, and expected duration.
          </p>
        </section>
        <p>
          Unauthorised replication, cloning, or flattening of symbolic systems into boring copies may result in karmic recursion.
        </p>
        <p>
          For licensing, commissioning, or diplomatic negotiations between dimensions, please <a href="/#contact" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">make contact</a> through appropriate portals.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/#contact" class="inline-block mt-12 md:mt-16 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[var(--text-silver-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text-silver)] transition-colors">
        ← Return
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
